## Typography rules

| Role | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Display / hero | `font-display`, `text-display`, `text-heading-lg` |
| Section headings | `text-heading`, `text-heading-sm` |
| Body | `font-body`, `text-body`, `text-body-sm` |
| Labels | `text-caption`, uppercase tracking |

**Fonts:** Montserrat 700 (display), Inter 400/600/700 (body/UI), Playfair optional sparingly.

Always apply letter-spacing from scale for display/heading sizes.

**PMP product pages** often use explicit pixel sizes for marketing hero (e.g. InputScreen `text-[34px] md:text-[52px]`) — OK inside product module; shell pages use token scale.

---

## Spacing rules

- Base unit: **4px** — use Tailwind multiples
- Section vertical padding: `py-[113px]` desktop, `py-60` mobile
- Card padding: `p-16` (shell); PMP inner cards often `p-5 md:p-6` or `px-6 md:px-8`
- Page horizontal gutter: `.px-page` (clamp in `globals.css`)
- Element gap: `gap-8`

---

## Border radius rules — STRICT (shell)

| Element | Radius | Class |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Cards, buttons | 8px | `rounded-md` |
| Icon containers | 44px | `rounded-pill` |
| Badges | 4px | `rounded-sm` |
| Full circle | — | `rounded-full` |

NEVER `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`, `rounded-2xl` for shell cards/buttons.

---

## Shadow rules — custom tokens ONLY

| Token | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `shadow-card` | Feature cards |
| `shadow-modal` | Modals, overlays |
| `shadow-drawer` | Mobile nav drawer |
| `shadow-subtle` | Ghost btn focus ring |
| `shadow-subtle-2` | Soft border card |
| `shadow-block` | Decorative offset block (homepage) |

NEVER Tailwind default `shadow-sm/md/lg/xl`.

---

## Button rules

**Primary CTA (shell):** `bg-obsidian text-white-canvas font-semibold rounded-md` — hover opacity-90

**Ghost secondary:** transparent + `border-midnight-ink`

**Product CTA (inside product modules):** `Button variant="product" gradient="bg-gradient-pmp"`

**PMP header actions:** compact ghost pills — `border-[#E5E7EB] bg-white text-[13px]` (see `AnswerPicker`, `LessonScreen`)

---

## Surface and section rules

1. `bg-white-canvas` — default page background
2. `bg-amber-glow` — hero, footer, accent blocks, **PMP page background**
3. `bg-white-canvas shadow-card` — elevated cards

Use amber-glow sparingly on marketing pages (max 2 sections). **PMP `/pmp` uses full-page `bg-amber-glow`** — intentional product immersion.

