## Sidebar layout pattern

**Reference:** `PMPLayout.tsx`, `PMPSidebar.tsx`

Use when a product module has **multiple tools/modes** (Mood 1, Mood 2, upload, glossary, calculators).

| Property | Value |
|----------|-------|
| Breakpoint | `lg:` and above only |
| Width expanded | `w-[220px]` |
| Width collapsed | `w-[56px]` |
| Sticky | `top-[56px] md:top-[64px]`, `h-[calc(100vh-56px)]` |
| Background | `bg-white border-r border-[#F3F4F6]` |
| Mobile | **Hidden** — use `PMPHeader` + hamburger navbar |

Sidebar actions call `PMPClientHandle` via ref — do not duplicate flow state in sidebar.

Active item state: `'mood1' | 'mood2' | 'upload' | 'glossary' | 'evm' | null`

