## Collapsible section component pattern

**Reference:** `CollapsibleSection` in `LessonScreen.tsx`

```typescript
interface CollapsibleSectionProps {
  title: string
  isExpanded: boolean
  onToggle: () => void
  accent?: string      // vertical bar color
  isFirst?: boolean    // first section: no top border
  children: React.ReactNode
}
```

**Visual rules:**
- NO card wrapper — only `border-t border-[#F3F4F6]` between sections
- Header: `px-0 py-5`, accent bar `w-1 h-5`, title `text-[15px] font-semibold`
- Content: `pb-8 pt-0` (no horizontal padding — document card provides it)
- Collapsed: header + divider only; content `hidden print:block` for PDF
- Chevron: `print:hidden`

